        <zone h='41000' id='16' w='26000' x='74000' y='31000' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#E0662B' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>HOW TO READ IT</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#E8E6E1' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='13'>Thermal load</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>Each county's heating gallons per home, minus its cooling demand per home, that month. +1 is all heating, -1 is all cooling.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#FFC46B' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='12'>Ember counties</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>Burn the most oil and propane: the winter delivery market.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5FB4E8' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='12'>Ice counties</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>Need the most AC: summer service work for full-service dealers.</run>
            </formatted-text>
