        <zone h='15000' id='5' w='72000' x='0' y='0' type-v2='text'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#E0662B' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>WHERE THE YEAR-ROUND MONEY IS  ·  218 COUNTIES</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#E8E6E1' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='30'>Size vs. intensity</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Full-service dealers sell fuel in winter and AC service in summer. Rank counties by total market or per home: the winners change almost completely.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
