            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#E0662B' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='10'>WHAT IT SHOWS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>By total, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#E8E6E1' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='11'>the big New York City and Boston counties</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'> lead: both heating and cooling grow with the number of homes.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>Per home, </run>
              <run fontcolor='#FFC46B' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='11'>oil-heavy towns outside the cities</run>
              <run fontcolor='#8B95A7' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'> with warm summers lead, like Sussex NJ, Northeastern Connecticut and Putnam NY: the best fit for a full-service dealer.</run>
            </formatted-text>
